      "data": {
        "title": "Derive Bands From Authored Views",
        "description": "Collect the graph’s exposed View nodes. Derive each default minPercent from its semantic role, allow data.semanticZoom.minPercent to override that View’s entry point, sort the collection, and choose the greatest reached threshold. If no View is eligible, render the graph’s passive minimap; below the compact threshold render its authored or generic glyph. The highest View may use expandAtPercent to choose when the full graph unfolds.",
        "differentiator": "The declaration does not enumerate representations. The available View collection is the authority. The generated minimap guarantees visible topology when no authored View fits, while the glyph guarantees a smallest representation.",
